# This directory vendors a modified copy of the third-party SceneTAP repo
# (https://github.com/tsingqguo/scenetap). Only the RIO-Bench-specific glue
# code is tracked here; generated outputs, logs, and further vendored
# third-party dependencies (SoM, unilm/TextDiffuser-2, incl. checkpoints)
# are intentionally excluded -- see README.md for how to obtain them.

# Ignore everything by default; only the curated files below are tracked.
*
